    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-alberti-avian-beak-darwin-scaling-measurement-14-species-universal-affine-scaling-and-shear-collapse-correlation-campas-et-al-2010-reference> a schema:PropertyValue ;
