    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-alberti-avian-beak-darwin-scaling-measurement-pass-3-gibson-ashby-trabecular-bv-tv-ablation-g-fortis-peak-keratin-stress-ratio-at-bv-tv-0-25-vs-1-0-base-biting> a schema:PropertyValue,
